      "id": "封面图",
      "title": "封面图",
      "items": [
        {
          "content": "<p>8月12日是“世界大象日”，西双版纳野象谷景区为大象准备了美食。（<a href=\"http://big5.xinhuanet.com/gate/big5/www.xinhuanet.com/photo/2020-08/12/c_1126359736.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">via</a>）</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "via",
              "url": "http://big5.xinhuanet.com/gate/big5/www.xinhuanet.com/photo/2020-08/12/c_1126359736.htm"
            }
